WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.842 --> 00:00:16.263
Von Buzz touched his helmet.

2
00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:18.605
"Fly away," he said.

3
00:00:20.627 --> 00:00:22.468
The bee grabbed Von Buzz and flew off.

4
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:26.091
The centipede and spider followed.

5
00:00:26.111 --> 00:00:31.796
"Grr!" Roxy struggled and squirmed on the web.

6
00:00:33.196 --> 00:00:34.836
"This spider web is too sticky!"

7
00:00:35.817 --> 00:00:36.677
She stopped moving.

8
00:00:36.697 --> 00:00:39.458
"I'll try my heat vision."

9
00:00:40.438 --> 00:00:41.978
Roxy turned her head toward the web.

10
00:00:43.039 --> 00:00:45.259
An orange beam radiated from her eyes.

11
00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:51.021
The spider web melted, and Roxy was free!

12
00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:53.882
"Whew!" said Roxy.

13
00:00:53.902 --> 00:00:58.303
"Now I have to find Von Buzz and destroy his helmet.

14
00:00:59.343 --> 00:01:01.504
He uses it to control those big bugs."

15
00:01:04.768 --> 00:01:06.849
Roxy found Von Buzz two blocks away.

16
00:01:07.949 --> 00:01:10.009
His bugs were breaking into another house.

17
00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:13.370
The villain saw Roxy.

18
00:01:14.411 --> 00:01:15.491
"How did you escape?"

19
00:01:15.771 --> 00:01:16.291
he cried.

20
00:01:17.191 --> 00:01:19.352
Von Buzz touched his helmet and looked at the bee.

21
00:01:19.372 --> 00:01:21.853
"Attack Rocket Girl!"

22
00:01:22.953 --> 00:01:24.433
The bee shot toward Roxy.

23
00:01:25.094 --> 00:01:27.194
Its giant stinger was pointed right at her.

24
00:01:27.214 --> 00:01:31.095
"Yikes!" cried Roxy, quickly moving out of the way.

25
00:01:32.136 --> 00:01:33.536
The bee crashed into a tree.

26
00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.601
Its stinger stuck into the tree's trunk.

27
00:01:37.521 --> 00:01:40.642
Buzz! The bee tried to pull its stinger out.

28
00:01:41.182 --> 00:01:42.742
But the stinger was in too deep.

29
00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:47.403
"Aargh!" Von Buzz looked next at the spider.

30
00:01:47.423 --> 00:01:49.764
"Attack Rocket Girl!"

31
00:01:51.465 --> 00:01:52.605
Fwit! Fwit!

32
00:01:53.305 --> 00:01:54.845
Spider webs shot toward Roxy.

33
00:01:55.526 --> 00:01:56.546
She took a deep breath.

34
00:01:57.106 --> 00:01:59.867
Whoosh! She blew as hard as she could.

35
00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.808
The webs flew back at the spider and stuck to its legs.

36
00:02:04.748 --> 00:02:05.708
The spider fell over.

37
00:02:05.728 --> 00:02:08.669
"Attack Rocket Girl!"

38
00:02:08.889 --> 00:02:09.769
cried Von Buzz.

39
00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.670
He looked at the centipede.

40
00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.051
The centipede just curled up into a ball again.

41
00:02:16.411 --> 00:02:17.912
Roxy glared at Von Buzz.

42
00:02:18.492 --> 00:02:21.533
Whiz-hoo! She fired her eye laser beams.

43
00:02:22.533 --> 00:02:24.093
Von Buzz's helmet blew apart.

44
00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:30.215
"No!" cried Von Buzz.

45
00:02:32.135 --> 00:02:33.896
Roxy dragged Von Buzz down the street.

46
00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:37.001
She found Detective Smith.

47
00:02:37.661 --> 00:02:38.682
Mr. Wig was with him.

48
00:02:39.862 --> 00:02:42.044
"Here you go, Detective," she said.

49
00:02:45.806 --> 00:02:47.727
done, young lady," said Mr.

50
00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:51.108
Wig. "You're more super than I'd realized.

51
00:02:51.989 --> 00:02:53.670
I'd like to give you a reward."

52
00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:56.111
Roxy saw her friends coming.

53
00:02:56.131 --> 00:02:58.132
"Thanks, Mr.

54
00:02:58.172 --> 00:02:59.413
Wig," said Roxy.

55
00:02:59.433 --> 00:03:02.274
"But I have a better idea.

56
00:03:03.235 --> 00:03:04.756
You can help out those kids."

57
00:03:05.892 --> 00:03:06.853
"Rocket Girl!"

58
00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:07.853
cried Terrell.

59
00:03:07.873 --> 00:03:11.395
"Does anyone want to buy some candy bars?"

60
00:03:11.715 --> 00:03:12.336
asked Mara.

61
00:03:13.456 --> 00:03:14.337
Roxy smiled.

62
00:03:14.357 --> 00:03:17.078
"Mr. Wig would like to buy some."

63
00:03:17.098 --> 00:03:20.620
"Oh, um, yes," said Mr.

64
00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:24.162
Wig. "I'll buy every candy bar you have!"

65
00:03:26.603 --> 00:03:28.805
Roxy found her friends again a few minutes later.

66
00:03:28.825 --> 00:03:32.006
"We sold all our candy bars!"

67
00:03:32.387 --> 00:03:32.967
said Jack.

68
00:03:32.987 --> 00:03:34.608
"And guess what!

69
00:03:34.992 --> 00:03:36.494
Rocket Girl helped us!"

70
00:03:36.514 --> 00:03:42.201
"I knew she could help us sell candy bars," said Terrell.

71
00:03:43.582 --> 00:03:44.744
Roxy just smiled.
